00:08:59.166 --> 00:09:02.041
Everybody thinks they're gonna
build Snapchat and Instagram.

00:09:02.041 --> 00:09:03.583
And I'm like, how
are you gonna do that

00:09:03.583 --> 00:09:04.750
when you're at Coachella?

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:06.542
How are you gonna do that
if you're out every night?

00:09:06.542 --> 00:09:07.375
How are you gonna do that

00:09:07.375 --> 00:09:10.375
when you're
raising money and you're,

00:09:10.375 --> 00:09:13.125
it's funny, raising
money has been so detrimental

00:09:13.125 --> 00:09:14.208
