00:09:14.208 --> 00:09:19.041
It doesn't take a hero
to lose $30,000 a month.

00:09:19.041 --> 00:09:22.083
Everybody in here can do that.

00:09:22.083 --> 00:09:24.834
And so, a couple
things I want to get across,

00:09:24.834 --> 00:09:26.500
and I wanna
really go into Q&amp;amp;A,

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.125
and get real
detailed 'cause I'm here.

00:09:29.125 --> 00:09:30.250
I'm not coming back.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.959
(audience laughter)

00:09:31.959 --> 00:09:35.375
So let's take advantage
of it, you know what I mean?

00:09:35.375 --> 00:09:37.667
So the couple
things that I think

00:09:37.667 --> 00:09:41.834
you need to really wrap your
head around is "it's for life."

00:09:41.834 --> 00:09:45.208
99% of the kids that walk into
my office or I come across,

00:09:45.208 --> 00:09:47.000
