to flip their shit.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.083
Which means they're
doing it for the money.

00:09:49.083 --> 00:09:50.792
And when you're doing
it just for the money,

00:09:50.792 --> 00:09:53.959
you've got way less chance
to actually make the money.

00:09:53.959 --> 00:09:55.792
So if you build a business,

00:09:55.792 --> 00:09:57.000
if you're in the mentality,

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:00.125
if you're in the
mindset of building it for life,

00:10:00.125 --> 00:10:01.458
you get slower.

00:10:01.458 --> 00:10:02.875
